# npm registry mapping.
# The package @claudebuddy/claudebuddy-agent-sdk publishes to npmjs by default
# (npmjs is the public registry — no token needed to install from it).
#
# Optional: to ALSO install from/publish to GitHub Packages, add:
#   @claudebuddy:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com/
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}
#
# NEVER commit a real token — keep using the ${GITHUB_TOKEN} placeholder.